-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div> <div data-v-2b4f6ec0="" id="toolcall-detail-7"><div data-v-897ffb8e="" data-v-8479c0d2="" data-v-2b4f6ec0="" class="terminal-detail-collapse"><div data-v-897ffb8e="" class="resize-container enable-grow-animation" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-897ffb8e="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail"><div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-connector terminal-detail-connector-top toolcall-vline" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-content"><div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-rail toolcall-vline" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-body"><div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-panel"><div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-sections is-split"><!----> <section data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-section terminal-detail-response-section"><!----> <!----></section></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-8479c0d2="" class="terminal-detail-connector terminal-detail-connector-bottom toolcall-vline" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-4f3bad81="" class="toolcall-flow__item"><div data-v-8f1d918e="" data-v-e3c80efd="" class="toolcall-container thinking-container block-container is-flat-think" share-mode="false"><div data-v-064cc47f="" data-v-8f1d918e="" class="toolcall-title-container default is-expandable"><div data-v-064cc47f="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-064cc47f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Dot"><path d="M512 384a128 128 0 1 1 0 256 128 128 0 0 1 0-256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-064cc47f="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Thinking complete</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-897ffb8e="" data-v-8f1d918e="" class="toolcall-content"><div class="scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden="true"></div><div data-v-897ffb8e="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-897ffb8e="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-8766e0de="" data-v-8f1d918e="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-8766e0de="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Done. Deliverables saved. Summarize results and design decisions briefly, tag files at the very end.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-b2cba09c="" class="toolcall-rollup__tail is-open"><div data-v-b2cba09c="" class="toolcall-rollup__tail-in"><div data-v-b2cba09c="" class="toolcall-rollup__tail-divider"></div> <!----> <div data-v-8766e0de="" data-v-e3c80efd="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-8766e0de="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Both built and tested live â€” and the test run answers Notebook's question concretely. Four fabricated evidence files (a video clip, a photo, a WAV, an EMF CSV) went through the full pipeline: classified by type, renamed to the <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_&lt;type&gt;_&lt;hash8&gt;</code> convention, SHA-256'd on ingest, manifest updated atomically, then the case closed and zipped. A verification pass re-hashed every stored file against the manifest â€” chain intact.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Design decisions I made that Notebook didn't specify, flag any of these:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Copy, not move, on ingest.</strong> The original file stays wherever it landed (phone, camera, Discord download) untouched. First thing a defense attorney â€” or a hostile forum â€” does is ask whether the original still exists. Now it always does.</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Atomic manifest writes</strong> (temp file + rename) so a crash mid-ingest can't corrupt the index. Closing a case flips <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">status</code> to <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">closed</code> and the ingest path hard-refuses further writes â€” evidence can't silently append after the archive is sealed.</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Files ending in <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">.finding.json</code></strong> are classified as <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">finding</code> type, so the analysis station's artifacts from earlier get their own section and manifest type.</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The CLI version in <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">ingest.py</code> is what the agents should wire into the <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">filesystem</code>/<code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">git</code> MCP layer â€” <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">new</code> / <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">ingest</code> / <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">close</code> map directly to Tara's UI buttons, and <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">git add</code> after each ingest gives you versioned manifests for free.</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The schema file validates against the sample manifest, so the agents have a contract to code against. Three files below â€” schema, CLI script, and the sample manifest from the test case.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Next link in the chain is still the sensor WebSocket protocol, since <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-8766e0de="" class="segment-code-inline">sensor-logs/</code> is currently fed by hand. Whenever you're ready.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><div data-v-f6319aea="" data-v-e3c80efd="" class="pua-ref-renderer pua-ref-renderer--4"><div data-v-822038f5="" class="preview-card card-enable-click card-hover-animate"><span data-v-bca724e6="" data-v-822038f5="" class="image-wrapper cover"><!----> <img data-v-bca724e6="" class="image-main" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://statics.kimi.ai/kimi-web/assets/json-DtQLMBn6.svg"> <!----></span> <div data-v-822038f5="" class="content"><div data-v-822038f5="" class="title">manifest.schema</div> <div data-v-822038f5="" class="subtitle">JSON</div></div> <button data-v-89edfdaf="" data-v-822038f5="" type="button" class="km-button km-button-secondary km-button-medium action-button"><!----> <span data-v-89edfdaf="" class="km-button-content">Preview</span> <!----></button></div></div>
